third_party/

# the local SACLA environment: only the scripts, stubs, README and examples are ours.
# Fetched from the HPC by sacla_local_api/scripts/fetch_sacla.sh (needs an HPC account): SACLA's
# libraries, headers and simulator data, and copies of system libraries. Not ours to publish.
sacla_local_api/software/
*venv/
*.env
sacla_local_api/hpc/

